{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "c4266147-e5f7-8195-a931-b5cef6d5ca45",
  "created_at": "2025-12-15T12:42:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Antonio Furtado",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Greg Lombardi",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:38:43-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Greg."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:38:46-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, good afternoon. Antonio Furtado, that's F-U-R-T-A-D-O. Can you hear me okay? I'm on my cell and the reception is not great where I am."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:38:57-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I got you, a little choppy but go ahead."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:39:01-05:00",
      "duration": 20,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I rent at 307 Old Beach Road, over by Easton's Beach. I want to put up a fence in the back yard, and I've been trying to find out the rules since, uh, Thursday. Actually Wednesday. I looked at the website Wednesday evening, around seven, and got nowhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:39:21-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. What kind of fence are we talking about?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:39:25-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A white picket style, six feet tall. The dog keeps slipping out of the yard whenever the gate gets opened, so [line breaks up] it needs to be solid enough that she can't get through or under."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:39:40-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You broke up on me there. Solid enough that she can't what?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:39:46-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Get through or under. The dog. She's a quick one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it. So your main question is whether you need a permit."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:39:57-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that's the central question. Does a fence need a permit, and is there any paperwork? Because the website sent me to three different pages and none of them said yes or no."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:40:11-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Generally, yes, a fence of that height usually does need a permit here, and six feet is on the tall side for a residential yard. There's an application, and you'd typically show where it's going on a simple sketch of the lot."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:40:28-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And I'm a renter, so does the application come from me or the landlord? I should say, the landlord already said verbally it's fine. That was November, I believe the twentieth."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:40:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Best to have that in writing. The owner usually has to sign off on it, so get an email or a note from them and bring it along."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:40:53-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright, written. Fine. Another thing, [inaudible] the finished side. Does the finished side have to face out, toward the neighbors and the street? Or can the posts face out?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:41:05-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sorry, say that once more, you cut out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:41:09-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The finished side of the fence. Does it have to face outward?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:41:15-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the usual expectation, yes, good side facing out, framing on your side. When you file, the staff can confirm the exact requirements for your lot, especially being close to the beach."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:41:28-05:00",
      "duration": 21,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I'd need to come in, or can I get the form somewhere without coming in? I'm only free on my lunch, and honestly I'm eating it standing in a hallway right now because I have a classroom party this afternoon and someone requested napkins. Napkins. So I'm running around."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:41:49-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ha, alright. You can pick the form up at the counter, or it's on the city website under building permits. Print it or fill it in and bring it with your sketch."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:42:02-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The website. Right. The same website that gave me the runaround. Which page, exactly?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:42:08-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Look under Inspections, then Permits and Applications. If you can't find it, call back and we'll email it, or stop by the office."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:42:18-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Inspections, then Permits and Applications. I'll try that tonight. If not I'll call tomorrow morning."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:42:25-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That works. We're here till the afternoon. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:42:29-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Thank you, Greg. I wish that had been clearer online, but I appreciate it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:42:37-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Good luck with the dog."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2025-12-15T12:42:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Bye."
    }
  ],
